      <tr> 
       <td width="228"> <span style="width:228px;font-size:10pt;">1. 보고서 명칭</span> </td> 
       <td colspan="3" width="373"> <span class="xforms_input" style="width:373px;font-size:10pt;">2021-2022 LG전자 지속가능경영보고서</span> </td> 
